('1776073643961', 'Marine Collagen', 'Myprotein', '1775155326490', '1775362757170', '<p>Our Marine Collagen delivers 10g of hydrolysed collagen peptides per 
serving, sourced from fish and naturally rich in glycine, proline, and 
hydroxyproline — the amino acids your body uses to maintain its own 
collagen structures. The low molecular weight means it dissolves easily,
 absorbs quickly, and won''t change the taste of whatever you''re adding 
it to. At around 82% protein with zero fat and zero sugar, it''s a 
fuss-free way to top up your collagen intake every day.</p>
<p>It''s designed to support skin hydration from within and help promote 
natural radiance — but collagen isn''t only about how you look. Protein 
also contributes to the maintenance of normal bones¹, so you''re looking 
after more than just your skin.</p>
