it with water. Available in Unflavoured, Pink Grapefruit, and Orange 
Mango. One scoop a day — the simplest habit you''ll add to your routine.</p><p><b><u>Key Benefits</u></b><br>10g hydrolysed marine collagen peptides per serving<br>Sourced from fish — one of the purest forms of collagen<br>Supports skin hydration from within<br>Helps promote natural radiance<br>Contributes to the maintenance of normal bones¹<br>Zero fat, zero sugar<br>Low molecular weight — dissolves easily, absorbs fast<br><br></p>', '["https://res.cloudinary.com/dbxna1ipc/image/upload/v1776073468/bybens-products/a.avif","https://res.cloudinary.com/dbxna1ipc/image/upload/v1776073472/bybens-products/aaaa.avif"]'::jsonb, '[{"unit":"g","price":8500,"stock":0,"weight":"300","flavorStock":{"Unflavored":0,"Pink Grapefruit":0}}]'::jsonb, '[{"qty":0,"name":"Unflavored"},{"qty":0,"name":"Pink Grapefruit"}]'::jsonb, 0, 0, true, '1775387552641', 'active', '<img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dbxna1ipc/image/upload/v1779398991/bybens-nutritional-facts/product_1776073643961_nutrifacts_0.png" alt="">', '<p><strong>Serving Size:</strong> 10g</p>
