('1775660539613', 'Active Men Bundle', 'Myprotein', '1775748358113', '', '<p><strong>What Is&nbsp; Active Men Bundle?</strong></p>
<p>This Active Men Bundle is the perfect combination of supplements to support everyday health.</p>
<p>Our Alpha Men Tablets are a unique formulation of over 35 vitamins 
and minerals, including vitamin C to promote immune function, vitamin B12 to fight feelings of tiredness and calcium to support 
bone health.</p>
<p>Myvitamins Omega 3&nbsp;Softgels are a high-quality source of essential 
fatty acids DHA and EPA. These nutrients play an important role in 
several functions within the body, including heart health, brain 
function and inflammation. In particular, they support normal blood 
pressure levels and maintain cognitive health, making them a 
must-have addition to your daily routine.</p>', '["https://res.cloudinary.com/dbxna1ipc/image/upload/v1775660481/bybens-products/Screenshot_2026-04-08_at_16-58-51_Can_use_these_two_products_and_generate_a_picture_so_that_I_can_put_them_as_a_pack_in_my_website_bybens.com_-_Google_Gemini.png"]'::jsonb, '[{"unit":"pcs","price":9000,"stock":0,"weight":"2","flavorStock":{"Unflavored":0}}]'::jsonb, '[{"qty":4,"name":"Unflavored"}]'::jsonb, 0, 10, true, '1775387552641', 'active', '', '', '2026-04-08 15:02:19.613+00', false),
