('1776089893510', 'Origin Pump Pre-Workout | Stim & Caffeine-Free', 'Myprotein', '1775660355541', '1775748332923', '<p>Experience the power of Origin Stim-Free Pre-Workout. A hard-hitting 
no-nonsense formula, packed with optimal doses of research-backed 
ingredients, and zero caffeine.</p>
<p>We’ve refined our powerful pre-workout blend by removing caffeine to 
